 "design": "R6 the same detection question asked of the margin battery.\n\nDesign fixed before running (2026-09-16, written 15:40 EDT). snap-r6-detect-power measures what the\naccuracy battery could have found, because the accuracy conclusion is the null one and a null result\nneeds its power stated. The margin conclusion is positive, and it needs the mirror statement, which is\nthe smallest true ratio the margin battery would have declared reliably. A reader comparing the two\nscales should be able to see that the margin battery is the more sensitive of the pair, and by how much,\nrather than taking it on the strength of one interval excluding one.\nThis run sweeps the true ratio over the same eight values at the margin battery's item noise of 0.73,\nwith 4,000 replicates per cell, and reports the rate at which the recipe-clustered interval excludes one\nalongside coverage. Read beside the accuracy sweep it gives the paper a pair of detection thresholds\nrather than a single one. Seed 20260970 keeps the draws distinct.\n",
